---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Wearables & Biometric data" description="Wearables & Biometric data - readysaltedcode story">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/stories">Stories</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>Wearables & Biometric data</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="story-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>One of the challenges when working with students is ensuring that their personal data is completely safe.  For this reason we are using live data in for the ballet and sharing only stored data from the choreographer who is over 18. The variety of sensors, boards and programming languages enable to project to be accessed by students of all ages and interests. From controlling LEDs in primary school through to the #biometric data and #VR development</p>
      <p><img loading="lazy" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-1466 aligncenter" src="https://www.readysaltedcode.org/images/FFFFFF-0.png?ZI1v4zCC1klQ8bltkqXGITEcu2umkF20Sr5LvcWpybYXuGjDJJMaISjBhccsP1mpyb2V9zuKcSHtC0-jOD0_8oYJiUhPeJlD-M7KvyIMiw=s300" alt="Screen Shot 2016-10-25 at 11.00.55" width="300" height="300" /></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  .breadcrumb { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #ccc; }
  .page-header h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .story-content { padding: 3rem 0; }
  .story-content .container { max-width: 800px; }
  .story-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-content img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 8px; }
  .story-content a { color: #dd3333; }
  .story-content blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #dd3333; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-style: italic; color: #555; }
  .story-content strong { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
